// AN ADDRESS TAKEN PAST THE PLACE WALK'S FUEL FAILS CLOSED (DEF-402; landing 175's review, F4).
//
// `note_addr_taken` reads the binding under a place with `place_root` and its 64 of fuel
// (`BORROW_FUEL`: 63 steps are read, the 64th exhausts it), and at the fuel it returned
// with nothing marked: a receiver 64 steps deep under a method taking `Self->` (`r.value`
// + 63 `.a`) took an address into `r` that the set never saw, so `r` stayed refined (the
// first build of 175 accepted this file; 63 steps it refused). The `@` spelling of the
// same place is the typer's `NITPICK-TYPE-024` at 64 steps (its own place walk), so the
// receiver is the one road. Now exhaustion sets `addr_deep`, and every refined read of
// the function refuses, as `expr_types.npk`'s rule for exhaustion says (fail closed).
// Generated shape: S0 holds an `int64`, S{i} holds an S{i-1}.
